"catalog (currently three operations), typed input/output JSON Schemas, allowed provider/kind, "
"publisher identity policy, approval policy and retry behavior. Sandbox orders require an explicit"
" committed human approve action covering the exact workflow and input. Timeouts after dispatch "
"require receipt lookup before retry. Metadata is not proof of executable credentials: connections"
" must separately be active, authorized, verified and pinned to the exact revision and secret "
"version. Endpoints and secrets are never returned. This read has no business side effects. "
"Missing/expired/revoked authentication returns 401; missing permission returns 403."

# APP-BE-021–025 additive contract documentation
msgid ""
"Requires an authenticated active session, requests.start and request participant view "
"authorization. Returns the latest AI attempt per execution, ordered by creation time and ID; page"
" defaults to 1, size defaults to 20 and is bounded to 100. Exposes the historical agent pin, "
"available model identity, allowed input field names, typed recommendation and existing task "
"budget/unknown usage. No input values, prompt, checkpoint, raw response trace, secret, private "
"URL or connection credential is returned. Human outcomes remain in the authorized work-"
"item/process timeline. A normal/high-confidence recommendation never authorizes a protected "
"order; that requires the exact committed human approval. Missing historical agent metadata is "
"marked unavailable, never replaced with a latest agent. Missing/expired authentication returns "
"401, missing permission 403, outsider or wrong process 404, invalid pagination 422. This read "
"makes no model call. Deterministic tests are not live-model quality or calibration evidence."
msgstr ""
"Requires an authenticated active session, requests.start and request participant view "
