# APP-BE-023 verified-receipt completion boundary
msgid "Resume a supported single process wait"
msgstr "Resume a supported single process wait"

# APP-BE-023 verified-receipt completion boundary
msgid ""
"Requires an authenticated active session, requests.start, request participant view and requester "
"control (or superuser). Supply a current process ref, command_key, declared outcome and handler-"
"valid outputs for an eligible single wait. Existing unprotected wait semantics are retained. "
"Subprocess results are settled by their owning worker. A sandbox.order.create/1 wait cannot "
"accept caller-supplied receipts: only the protected worker or authorized receipt lookup may "
"confirm it. Human business approval must use the actual eligible work-item completion action. "
"Replay follows the existing command-key behavior; this is not an arbitrary effect executor. "
"Errors: 401 missing/expired authentication, 403 missing permission/control, 404 outsider/missing "
"process, 409 stale ref, ambiguous/ineligible wait or invented protected receipt, 422 invalid "
"input. Queued sandbox work is never confirmed by this command."
msgstr ""
"Requires an authenticated active session, requests.start, request participant view and requester "
"control (or superuser). Supply a current process ref, command_key, declared outcome and handler-"
"valid outputs for an eligible single wait. Existing unprotected wait semantics are retained. "
"Subprocess results are settled by their owning worker. A sandbox.order.create/1 wait cannot "
"accept caller-supplied receipts: only the protected worker or authorized receipt lookup may "
"confirm it. Human business approval must use the actual eligible work-item completion action. "
"Replay follows the existing command-key behavior; this is not an arbitrary effect executor. "
"Errors: 401 missing/expired authentication, 403 missing permission/control, 404 outsider/missing "
"process, 409 stale ref, ambiguous/ineligible wait or invented protected receipt, 422 invalid "
"input. Queued sandbox work is never confirmed by this command."

#: src/apps/workflows/domain/dtos/graph.py
