msgid ""
"For STEP_OUTPUT, the exact pinned output-port schema, including generic service metadata. "
"Registered sandbox receipt guarantees refine server-side compatibility without changing persisted"
" port metadata or graph checksums. Caller-supplied schema assertions cannot replace the trusted "
"operation contract."
msgstr ""
